- [results.json](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-empirical-ai-ml-research-pick-one-open-con/workspace/results.json)
- [results.csv](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-empirical-ai-ml-research-pick-one-open-con/workspace/results.csv)
